{
  "_comment": [
    "Popular Rainmeter suites for tools/suitecheck.py. The skins are third-party: download them",
    "yourself from the url into <corpus>/<dir>/ (one folder per suite) and keep them out of this repo.",
    "package: .rmskin glob under the corpus folder; folder: an unpacked skin folder (absolute or under the corpus).",
    "configs: [config, file, x, y] to load instead of the package's own Load (a welcome or setup skin);",
    "x / y are where a user would drag it, and are optional. layout: a layout to load instead.",
    "bangs: run after loading. wait: seconds before the screenshot."
  ],
  "suites": [
    {
      "name": "illustro",
      "url": "https://github.com/rainmeter/rainmeter/tree/master/Build/Skins/illustro",
      "folder": "/root/rmsrc/Build/Skins/illustro",
      "configs": [
        [
          "illustro\\Clock",
          "Clock.ini",
          40,
          40
        ],
        [
          "illustro\\System",
          "System.ini",
          40,
          130
        ],
        [
